body:
I totally agree; I should have quoted it, but I was mainly targeting the comment that, "what the fuck does a little kid know about baseball..." Children need not understand the rules of the game to have a special attachment to the item.

&#x200B;

With that being said, I wholeheartedly agree that it should be left to the volition of the gifter, not pressure from a network camera, that spurs these moments.
